(7006670, 1060128, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is such a magnificent landscape! The lighting and tones and colors are all wonderful! And what a sky! 8</td>', 'This is such a magnificent landscape! The lighting and tones and colors are all wonderful! And what a sky! 8', '2013-03-25 20:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
