(7006673, 1059037, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely seascape! The pastel colors of the sky are great!! Wish the horizon was a little higher up in the frame though to catch some more of the sky''s reflection.</td>', 'Lovely seascape! The pastel colors of the sky are great!! Wish the horizon was a little higher up in the frame though to catch some more of the sky''s reflection.', '2013-03-25 20:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
