(7006691, 1060340, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting! If the crop was a little tighter, maybe cutting out the plant on the far left, there''d be more space to see all the details in the fine structures of the leaves?</td>', 'Nice color and lighting! If the crop was a little tighter, maybe cutting out the plant on the far left, there''d be more space to see all the details in the fine structures of the leaves?', '2013-03-25 21:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
