(7006693, 1060241, 124982, '<td valign="top">That''s a great tribute -- very apt words! And the image, well, it''s beautiful. Dont know how you managed to get such a sharp bird, but soft waves like that! However it was achieved, its perfection!</td>', 'That''s a great tribute -- very apt words! And the image, well, it''s beautiful. Dont know how you managed to get such a sharp bird, but soft waves like that! However it was achieved, its perfection!', '2013-03-25 21:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006695, 1060194, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture.</td>', 'Beautiful texture.', '2013-03-25 21:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006696, 1058031, 8759, '<td valign="top">She would like it. A sad spring indeed... <br/> <br/>Personally I would have taken away the bottom stick which attracts the view from the beautifully framed flowers. BW works well</td>', 'She would like it. A sad spring indeed...  Personally I would have taken away the bottom stick which attracts the view from the beautifully framed flowers. BW works well', '2013-03-25 21:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006697, 1059082, 124982, '<td valign="top">PERFECT!! What an imagination! And so very poignant! We will miss her shout very much.</td>', 'PERFECT!! What an imagination! And so very poignant! We will miss her shout very much.', '2013-03-25 21:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006698, 1058012, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such lovely artwork. I could see this hanging on my wall somewhere!</td>', 'Such lovely artwork. I could see this hanging on my wall somewhere!', '2013-03-25 21:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006699, 1059915, 8759, '<td valign="top">True. Nicely executed, crisp and clear</td>', 'True. Nicely executed, crisp and clear', '2013-03-25 21:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006701, 1059985, 124982, '<td valign="top">Good gracious...I almost cut my eyeballs when I saw how sharp that flower was!! The detail and clarity is spectacular -- I would love to have images this sharp! Not sure the brown flower on the right adds to the composition, probably would''ve cropped that and brought more focus to the flower and bee.</td>', 'Good gracious...I almost cut my eyeballs when I saw how sharp that flower was!! The detail and clarity is spectacular -- I would love to have images this sharp! Not sure the brown flower on the right adds to the composition, probably would''ve cropped that and brought more focus to the flower and bee.', '2013-03-25 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006702, 1058908, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such minimal, unadulterated beauty. The geometry is gorgeous!</td>', 'Such minimal, unadulterated beauty. The geometry is gorgeous!', '2013-03-25 21:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006703, 1060334, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely! The tones and lighting and color are all very alluring!</td>', 'Quite lovely! The tones and lighting and color are all very alluring!', '2013-03-25 21:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006704, 1058737, 124982, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, this is great! The pink flowers literally burst from the screen! Quite gorgeously sharp and vivid!</td>', 'Oh yes, this is great! The pink flowers literally burst from the screen! Quite gorgeously sharp and vivid!', '2013-03-25 21:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006705, 1058751, 124982, '<td valign="top">I love it. This is just the kind of image Shez would''ve loved. The simple curve of a leaf, the smooth shape, the vivid color. Very nice!</td>', 'I love it. This is just the kind of image Shez would''ve loved. The simple curve of a leaf, the smooth shape, the vivid color. Very nice!', '2013-03-25 21:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006706, 1060231, 124982, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest, I have no idea what I''m looking at...but it''s exceptionally pretty! Such wonderful shapes and colors and textures! A touch oversharpened though (can see artifacts throughout the background), but otherwise most lovely!</td>', 'I''ll be honest, I have no idea what I''m looking at...but it''s exceptionally pretty! Such wonderful shapes and colors and textures! A touch oversharpened though (can see artifacts throughout the background), but otherwise most lovely!', '2013-03-25 21:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006707, 1058613, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh... Yes!    She did.<br/> <br/> <br/>This is beautiful!<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Oh... Yes!    She did.  This is beautiful!   (commenting only)', '2013-03-25 21:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006709, 1060283, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very electric neon colors -- quite appealing. It looks like a light indeed. Lovely!</td>', 'Very electric neon colors -- quite appealing. It looks like a light indeed. Lovely!', '2013-03-25 21:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006710, 1059807, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.<br/> <br/> <br/>Well done.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Fabulous.  Well done.   (commenting only)', '2013-03-25 21:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006711, 1059702, 124982, '<td valign="top">YES! YES! YES!! Just beautifully intricate details that Shez adored. You captured her perfectly in this image!</td>', 'YES! YES! YES!! Just beautifully intricate details that Shez adored. You captured her perfectly in this image!', '2013-03-25 21:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006712, 1060205, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and tones!</td>', 'Lovely colors and tones!', '2013-03-25 21:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006713, 1059736, 124982, '<td valign="top">A lovely flower, and a fitting tribute!</td>', 'A lovely flower, and a fitting tribute!', '2013-03-25 21:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006714, 1059998, 124982, '<td valign="top">Perfectly lit flower!! So hard to do this without highlights blowing out. You''re lighting is so smooth, really brings out the detail and texture in the flower.</td>', 'Perfectly lit flower!! So hard to do this without highlights blowing out. You''re lighting is so smooth, really brings out the detail and texture in the flower.', '2013-03-25 21:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006715, 1058967, 124982, '<td valign="top">As we all do -- those are lovely cheetah''s!</td>', 'As we all do -- those are lovely cheetah''s!', '2013-03-25 21:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006716, 1060162, 124982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous bird -- the detail and sharpness is very impressive! And the green background --- how on earth did you achieve that!?!! It''s delicious!</td>', 'Gorgeous bird -- the detail and sharpness is very impressive! And the green background --- how on earth did you achieve that!?!! It''s delicious!', '2013-03-25 21:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006717, 1059946, 124982, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous flower wonderfully rendered! A lovely tribute indeed!</td>', 'A gorgeous flower wonderfully rendered! A lovely tribute indeed!', '2013-03-25 21:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006718, 1059364, 124982, '<td valign="top">A great homage! The colors are wonderful! A little work on the lighting and composition and this would''ve popped so much more!</td>', 'A great homage! The colors are wonderful! A little work on the lighting and composition and this would''ve popped so much more!', '2013-03-25 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006719, 1058712, 124982, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp and clear! The details and color just POP! Great image!</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp and clear! The details and color just POP! Great image!', '2013-03-25 21:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006720, 1057859, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such an ethereal image, very though-provoking and introspective.</td>', 'Such an ethereal image, very though-provoking and introspective.', '2013-03-25 21:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006721, 1058502, 124982, '<td valign="top">My oh my, I don''t think you could''ve gotten this rose any sharper if you had tried! Just delightful! Crisp, sharp details and textures! Beautiful.</td>', 'My oh my, I don''t think you could''ve gotten this rose any sharper if you had tried! Just delightful! Crisp, sharp details and textures! Beautiful.', '2013-03-25 21:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006722, 1059797, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very crisp looking image! Lovely colors and detail!</td>', 'Very crisp looking image! Lovely colors and detail!', '2013-03-25 21:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006723, 1060140, 124982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully warm lighting! Nice depth of focus.</td>', 'Beautifully warm lighting! Nice depth of focus.', '2013-03-25 21:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006724, 1058639, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderful tribute -- both textually and visually. The words are touching and the image sublime. One of the top images to date.</td>', 'This is such a wonderful tribute -- both textually and visually. The words are touching and the image sublime. One of the top images to date.', '2013-03-25 21:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006726, 1059915, 124982, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!! Can''t figure out what this is...but it''s beautiful!! Just gorgeous colors and composition!</td>', 'Spectacular!! Can''t figure out what this is...but it''s beautiful!! Just gorgeous colors and composition!', '2013-03-25 21:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006728, 1060369, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition...very sharp and colorful!</td>', 'Lovely composition...very sharp and colorful!', '2013-03-25 21:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006729, 1060161, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely long-exposure image! Just love the milky appearance to the water! Wish we could see a little more of the woods above the falls!</td>', 'Lovely long-exposure image! Just love the milky appearance to the water! Wish we could see a little more of the woods above the falls!', '2013-03-25 21:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006731, 1059802, 124982, '<td valign="top">If I must guess, I would say this is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_music</a> image? Regardless, the processing on this is delightful -- such fantastic tones and contrast and detail. A very moving composition!</td>', 'If I must guess, I would say this is a  Bear_music image? Regardless, the processing on this is delightful -- such fantastic tones and contrast and detail. A very moving composition!', '2013-03-25 21:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006732, 1060059, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such a gorgeous composition! So fitting a tribute for Shez! She would''ve loved this. The soft-focus/glow just makes it!</td>', 'Such a gorgeous composition! So fitting a tribute for Shez! She would''ve loved this. The soft-focus/glow just makes it!', '2013-03-25 21:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006733, 1059914, 124982, '<td valign="top">Incredibly colorful composition, quite unique! Beautiful lighting.</td>', 'Incredibly colorful composition, quite unique! Beautiful lighting.', '2013-03-25 21:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006734, 1059836, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely shades of purple/pink. For some reason, this image I find very soothing to the soul.</td>', 'Lovely shades of purple/pink. For some reason, this image I find very soothing to the soul.', '2013-03-25 21:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006736, 1058615, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very unique processing! At first I wasn''t sure about it, but it''s grown on me. Such luminescent color, so bold and unashamed!</td>', 'Very unique processing! At first I wasn''t sure about it, but it''s grown on me. Such luminescent color, so bold and unashamed!', '2013-03-25 21:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006737, 1058450, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is a most beautiful image. Something about the focus and DoV makes this such a serene, soothing image. You captured a feeling in me that I normally do not feel in images. Very unique.</td>', 'This is a most beautiful image. Something about the focus and DoV makes this such a serene, soothing image. You captured a feeling in me that I normally do not feel in images. Very unique.', '2013-03-25 21:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006739, 1057925, 124982, '<td valign="top">The pinks and greens make such a fine pairing together! Quite lovely! Not sure if the composition would''ve been stronger if the flowers were face on?</td>', 'The pinks and greens make such a fine pairing together! Quite lovely! Not sure if the composition would''ve been stronger if the flowers were face on?', '2013-03-25 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006740, 1059992, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely toned B&amp;W image. Just adored all the details and definition!</td>', 'Lovely toned B&W image. Just adored all the details and definition!', '2013-03-25 21:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006741, 1060364, 124982, '<td valign="top">So peaceful and soothing this image. Lovely soft glow to the flower, and not overly sharpened, but very natural.</td>', 'So peaceful and soothing this image. Lovely soft glow to the flower, and not overly sharpened, but very natural.', '2013-03-25 21:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006742, 1057729, 124982, '<td valign="top">A beautiful splash of pink against the yellow background! Focus is a smidge soft, but perhaps that was the effect you were going for?</td>', 'A beautiful splash of pink against the yellow background! Focus is a smidge soft, but perhaps that was the effect you were going for?', '2013-03-25 21:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006743, 1059765, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite painterly feel to this, which does it justice! Quite mellow and peaceful! True to the nature of this tribute.</td>', 'Quite painterly feel to this, which does it justice! Quite mellow and peaceful! True to the nature of this tribute.', '2013-03-25 21:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006744, 1059828, 124982, '<td valign="top">A jukebox perhaps? Shez''s song will play forever at DPC</td>', 'A jukebox perhaps? Shez''s song will play forever at DPC', '2013-03-25 21:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006745, 1060049, 124982, '<td valign="top">Simple, minimal, lovely. You captured the essence of the challenge wonderfully.</td>', 'Simple, minimal, lovely. You captured the essence of the challenge wonderfully.', '2013-03-25 21:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006746, 1058763, 124982, '<td valign="top">A beautiful splash of sunshine! Very sharp and crisp. Wonderfully focused! Wish the background wasn''t grey though.</td>', 'A beautiful splash of sunshine! Very sharp and crisp. Wonderfully focused! Wish the background wasn''t grey though.', '2013-03-25 21:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006748, 1060244, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very warming and soothing this image! The orange is like liquid sunshine!</td>', 'Very warming and soothing this image! The orange is like liquid sunshine!', '2013-03-25 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7006749, 1060034, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is too precious! Through so much adversity in her life, Shez prevailed like this flower in the snow. You captured the spirit of this challenge perfectly. So very beautiful.</td>', 'This is too precious! Through so much adversity in her life, Shez prevailed like this flower in the snow. You captured the spirit of this challenge perfectly. So very beautiful.', '2013-03-25 21:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
