(7030638, 1060324, 159493, '<td valign="top">There are so many elements both in your work and your words that my darling girl would have loved. Thank you or this beautiful Tribute to Sherryl (Shez). Kismet</td>', 'There are so many elements both in your work and your words that my darling girl would have loved. Thank you or this beautiful Tribute to Sherryl (Shez). Kismet', '2013-05-01 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7030644, 1060322, 159493, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous piece of work and I know that Sherryl (Shez) would love it. She was actually looking forward to her final journey and the release from the body she lived in. She had always been happy to be herself as she was until those last few months. I know that she would see this as her journey to a new start. Thank you for giving this Tribute to my darling girl. Kismet</td>', 'This is a gorgeous piece of work and I know that Sherryl (Shez) would love it. She was actually looking forward to her final journey and the release from the body she lived in. She had always been happy to be herself as she was until those last few months. I know that she would see this as her journey to a new start. Thank you for giving this Tribute to my darling girl. Kismet', '2013-05-01 20:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7030646, 1058639, 159493, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image and I know Sherryl (Shez) would love it. This touches me very deeply as I feel like that flower mourning the separation of a very special petal. Thank you! Kismet</td>', 'This is a beautiful image and I know Sherryl (Shez) would love it. This touches me very deeply as I feel like that flower mourning the separation of a very special petal. Thank you! Kismet', '2013-05-01 20:57:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7030647, 1059609, 159493, '<td valign="top">I look at this work and feel Sherryl''s (Shez) freedom. It made me think f how much she wanted to be able to just get outside again. I then read Ryan''s comment and thought "yes, she would have wanted a stool" But, maybe she doesn''t need one now. Thank you! Kismet</td>', 'I look at this work and feel Sherryl''s (Shez) freedom. It made me think f how much she wanted to be able to just get outside again. I then read Ryan''s comment and thought "yes, she would have wanted a stool" But, maybe she doesn''t need one now. Thank you! Kismet', '2013-05-01 21:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
